--- selector
Does the change release a lock, semaphore or mutex before an awaited persistence call completes?
--- prompt
Look for a lock release that runs before an awaited save. Judge whether a second writer can
enter while the save is in flight.
--- humans
Releasing a lock before the save completes lets two writers interleave.
--- rationale
Missed in review twice in 2026 (order lock, invoice lock).
